  "content": "# 森林生物群系維度\n\n森林生物群系維度將森林生物群系作為一個獨立的維度。僅使用自定義生物群系源生成森林生物群系及其變化。\n\n![預覽](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/63pdCQ3Y/images/fd92ad17a3cabe92cf221e159babc22097413163.jpeg)\n\n## 使用方法\n\n要進入森林生物群系維度，請使用黑曜石框架構建傳送門，并在框架頂部的兩個角放置橡木原木，底部的兩個角放置粗製泥土，如下所示：\n\n![森林生物群系維度傳送門](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d78d4796d44d15390f5069c9569e76fa85167007.png)\n\n## 兼容性\n\n- Base or Library\n  - [Biomes](https://modrinth.com/project/PxfTEarK)\n    - [TerraBlender (BoP, OTWBG, RU, etc)](https://modrinth.com/project/AeAYU1UM)\n- [乘客傳送門修復](https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA)\n- **Create** 插件：[Create: 傳送門整合](https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb)\n\n## 問題報告\n\n目前沒有新的兼容性問題或錯誤報告。如果您遇到問題，請在 [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-forestbiomesdimension/issues) 上反饋，以便我們進行修復。\n\n## 支持版本\n\n🟩 26.1-26.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2\n\n🟩 已支持  \n🟥 停止支持  \n🟨 處理中  \n🟪 考慮中\n\n## 說明\n\n您可以在模組包、視頻、直播等媒體中使用此內容。如果喜歡這個模組，感謝您的財務支持，我會非常感激。\n\n<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 GitHub 查看我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 CurseForge 獲取\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"觀看我在 YouTube 的視頻\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Discord 與我交流\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 支持我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 支持我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Saweria 支持我\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionfixer\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"維度修復\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionlink\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"維度鏈接\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/worldportal\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"世界傳送門\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vanillaworld\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"原版維度\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/morecatvariants\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"更多貓變體\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passengersportalfix\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"乘客傳送門修復\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/createportalintegration\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Create: 傳送門整合\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/8SpfTsnq\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-superflatdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/superflatdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"超平坦維度\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/y4wxFDPW\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-amplifieddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/amplifieddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"放大維度\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Fo9Xodfg\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-largebiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/largebiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"大型生物群系維度\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Y3EdVfom\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-mushroomfieldsdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/mushroomfieldsdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"蘑菇場維度\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/ItO3yfpJ\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-beta173dimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/beta173dimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Beta 1.7.3 維度\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HkbFed4W\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-desertdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/desertdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"沙漠維度\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HW5SOOxi\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-badlandsbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/badlandsbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"惡地生物群系維度\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/SrhObyPX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-thevoiddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/thevoiddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"虛空維度\"></a>\n</p>",
